From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 07:00:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Isolate stalled threaded WAL Home notifications

Reserve notification capacity for each registered shipper so one Home can stop receiving while the WAL session continues to serve other Homes.

Keep open results, breaks, and close requests ordered. Fold repeated maintenance notices into bounded slots and release queued notices when the local shipper unregisters.

